    "theorem": "SmallPrimeTraceGeometryAudit.small_prime_trace_geometry_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem small_prime_trace_geometry_certificate : (Nat.card (WeierstrassCurve.Affine F2)=32 ∧ Nat.card {W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F2 // W.Δ≠0}=16 ∧ Nat.card (WeierstrassCurve.Affine F3)=243 ∧ Nat.card {W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F3 // W.Δ≠0}=162 ∧ Nat.card {W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F2 // W.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular W}=8 ∧ Nat.card {W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F3 // W.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular W}=54) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K),W.Δ≠0 → Nat.card W.Point=equationCount W ∧ fieldTrace W=countedTrace W) ∧ (∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F2,W.Δ≠0 → (sourceSupersingular W ↔ W.a₁=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (W.baseChange Closure2))=1) ∧ (fieldTrace W)^2≤4*(Fintype.card F2:ℤ) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W → (Nat.card W.Point=1 ∨ Nat.card W.Point=3 ∨ Nat.card W.Point=5) ∧ TraceSquares (Fintype.card F2) (fieldTrace W) ∧ ∀ r : ℕ,r∣Nat.card W.Point → Nat.Coprime r 2 ∧ orderOf (2:ZMod r)∣4 ∧ orderOf (2:ZMod r)≤4)) ∧ (∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F3,W.Δ≠0 → (sourceSupersingular W ↔ W.b₂=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.General.ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange Closure3))=1) ∧ (fieldTrace W)^2≤4*(Fintype.card F3:ℤ) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W → (Nat.card W.Point=1 ∨ Nat.card W.Point=4 ∨ Nat.card W.Point=7) ∧ TraceSquares (Fintype.card F3) (fieldTrace W) ∧ ∀ r : ℕ,r∣Nat.card W.Point → Nat.Coprime r 3 ∧ orderOf (3:ZMod r)∣6 ∧ orderOf (3:ZMod r)≤6)) ∧ (quarticControl.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular quarticControl ∧ Nat.card quarticControl.Point=5 ∧ Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (quarticControl.baseChange Closure2))=1 ∧ addOrderOf quarticPoint=5 ∧ orderOf (2:ZMod 5)=4) ∧ (sexticControl.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular sexticControl ∧ Nat.card sexticControl.Point=7 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsionRankAudit.General.ThreeTorsion (sexticControl.baseChange Closure3))=1 ∧ addOrderOf sexticPoint=7 ∧ orderOf (3:ZMod 7)=6)",
    "decl_sha256": "5dd2bfab4c198ae74c973e7ecc7475ea3968776fcbd35839b4cf0f0793457e89",
    "scope": "Complete actual-model F2/F3 kernel census and source-trace/geometricp-torsion coupling: rawcoefficientmodels32/243,nonsingular16/162,actualsourceSSmodels8/54. Genericallfinitefieldsactualpointcard=computableequationpaircountplusidentity, actualfieldTrace=countedTrace viaactualpointequivalence. Every nonsingular F2/F3model: sourceIntgcd(trace,q)!=1 iff a1zero/b2zero iffactualgeometrickilledp subgroupcard1; actualHasseinequality, derivedTraceSquares/sourcepointcountcases{1,3,5}/{1,4,7}, no Hasse/classificationpremise. Everyactualpointcountdivisor r, includingcomposite, hascoprimalityandcyclotomicmodularorderdividing4/6andbound4/6. No claimeverycountdivisorisacyclicpointorder. ExplicitactualF2y²+y=x³+x/P(0,0)order5/geometric2tor1/modularorder4; actualF3y²=x³+2x+1/P(0,1)order7/geometric3tor1/modularorder6. Sourcep>=5conditionretained, examplesnotqualifiedsourcecounterexamples. No generalp/extensionfield/Hasse/Endrank/fulltorsionfielddegree theorem, other-primeBK/fullallkp500/original14completion, source-readpromotion/novelty/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
